                <note rend="inline" type="source">715.1715/430: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in
                        Honduras</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Lay</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1931-02-19T17:00:00-05:00">February 19, 1931—5
                        p.m.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>13. The following telegram to Managua is repeated for your information and for
                    action by you in accordance with paragraph 3. Please report results.</p>
                <p>[Here follows text of telegram No. 19, February 19, 5 p.m. to the Minister in
                    Nicaragua, printed <hi rendition="#italic">supra.</hi>]</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Stimson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
